IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ira-dates`
IMPORT `ira-core`

-- Industrial Relations Act 1996 (NSW) -- THE SEAT OF THE EMPLOYEE (or worker) BRINGING THE CLAIM: the dismissed
-- employee, the public sector employee facing a disciplinary decision, the worker who is party to a contract said to be
-- unfair, the employee or job applicant who was victimised, and the person owed pay or other money. Every question is
-- asked as that person would ask it, from facts that person can state; the Commission's judgments are asked as
-- conditions or answered conditionally. The rules are in ira-core.l4; this module restates none of them.
--
-- UNOFFICIAL. Based on content from the New South Wales Legislation website at 10 March 2025, via the Open Australian
